This Terraform program sets up an AWS environment with a main VPC, two subnets across different availability zones, and a security group to allow database access. It also configures a 10 GB 5.7 MySQL RDS instance with public accessibility, linked to the defined subnets and security group, outputting the database endpoint for connectivity, and with gp2 storage type. The program uses the specified IaC Intent Graph IR as the implementation plan.

